  "content": {
    "title": "关于转发开展2022年高校职业生涯咨询特色工作室建设工作的通知",
    "source": "吉林省高等学校毕业生就业指导中心",
    "publishDate": "2022-04-26",
    "bodyHtml": "\n                        <p>各普通高校：</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;教育部学生服务与素质发展中心下发了《关于开展2022年高校职业生涯咨询特色工作室建设工作的通知》，现转发给你们，请各高校按照要求积极申报，于5月17日前向省中心提交推荐材料，省中心遴选后统一报送教育部学生服务与素质发展中心。具体要求见附件。</p>\n\n<p>联系人：秦宁</p>\n\n<p>邮箱：qinning@jilinjobs.cn</p>\n\n<p>电话：13596126121</p>\n\n<p>附件：《关于开展2022年高校职业生涯咨询特色工作室建设工作的通知》</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 吉林省高等学校毕业生就业指导中心</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 2022年4月26日&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"1011\" src=\"migration-resource://4596b7223532477f0365564881d5b9dfa31b34716292be899a19859c07252717\" width=\"788\"></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"1003\" src=\"migration-resource://b7a63ad8b239378f561f0f55507af2543ce418082222ad0f4d996b4188337c40\" width=\"786\"></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"678\" src=\"migration-resource://4dfda4230b882ff3472f68c39e40d1cf9645c93507434707c26af1f5487a4dc6\" width=\"786\"></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"978\" src=\"migration-resource://49c2d9f7d31f519323c98adf4f5d63ce2a9d9ac00aef4b510d9fa141d32d30d3\" width=\"786\"></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"1013\" src=\"migration-resource://02f7c45226e4b3a9d4956d112da4f51cddee85742b4e3ae0ee6078e86127e811\" width=\"788\"></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"1023\" src=\"migration-resource://b5402f0f692830e60f52fea3600f0ad579dcab4d6058b0ad87555ae39d2f6521\" width=\"788\"></p>\n\n                    ",
